{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1538,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8c85556092dd34574b1474fa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "众人的愿望，汇聚成了璀璨星河……。\n呐，你会祈祷什么？\n我祈求……温柔的寂静。献给所有的夜晚。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9566f6f0c543c99ea193e57f91955aac291b164217d940ef856b3a22cd8e0cdb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e932057733a5d6e95a05f603",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "黄金船她们好像正兴致勃勃的。\n你也要小心别被她们恶作剧了。\n我？我什么都不会做的。……大概吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ebb555ddfce7207ccb0818cc1f6b012619f13ef41d2da136bc818d90dec4dfbe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6be90a3ffa6f06c2241d40f4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这段时期梦旅难得地固执呢……\n似乎无论如何都想聚在一起度过\n真是个可爱的家伙。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1b5f0e5b3f39c622fdd7d9f69dfa8a29163a2cde19238032f38e7c490c3b607",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:06ebf7b4a7a1d54803db43d7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "神圣之夜，应有神圣之梦……\n偶尔也让我们安静地，聊聊天吧。\n咖啡，我会泡好的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "575148711b24357f2cd05a9ca8ff32fb82f64b5f21b4c657f66182a227c76f37",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8be76f6074c4b98df71d2fc4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是我们的胜利。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa9036081a7f482faf55dbd165feddb264071e3493ed3b9588d8f35fee1b2ce2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e61099e4714207c831a13486",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这一年，是场似长实短的旅行呢。\n稍作休息，就要前往下一个时光了。\n你到那时候……也会在吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e5f6964871a831af2daee4ad487eb4da050531f9dfbbca9ac48d2fe5a1e8daf0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49c75b9055ded2404172359a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "祝你生日快乐。\n……嗯？今天是你的生日吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a37cd41ad51f2384439bc623bffec57d3c68fbf9d39f951c83884ca8cb08344f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:807bd41dc21980fe290b6c83",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你降生、活到现在，\n不断选择自己的道路……此刻就在这里。\n那一路留下怎样的辙印……都很美哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce95e7bb191efb54f7ee5e175536f48908bf39eddb10a9726a099e4595310d4f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2afb4a6a1cbfeb31d448505d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天计划被塞得格外满呢……\n真是忙个不停啊。\n要不要干脆直接消失一阵子呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ab0faab0d932d5e277cd0d81c3a19d3636f64e391bc124bf779d7e7859e2cd9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8cd443844dfe6f98eba1a019",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "本来想出去走走的……算了。\n毕竟你特意来见我了。\n那我就……老实被你抓住吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d37106b0dbf8c6e1ed962e4b22fd14e448730aee85714e769827ba82a9be82f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e3b7f95d2dc0c4eefa9a7082",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "收到通知了哦。\n要不要确认，就随你便了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f40497cd6ae55b89d39f4f61f1f10dbada4f21c430c2261074df021b77030827",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:794d35e39215a935ef2af3c0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "据说是礼物。\n这下可有看头了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "70d0c0404800b06fcfb4fe5c7bf34515dff1df1d6ab88458ca0aa42ce904027d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:027e0580b8a069c67d38a176",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哦，完成任务了吗？\n了不起了不起。",
      "source_fingerprint": "447386d351857be04c051098acf4072586d38e429a28063bebab542ef312fb71",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e54b2c00a057780284f6c5d4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次似乎会有活动。\n姑且去瞄上一眼吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb3fd9cedd567fc8bfce3e7c8e689e5d9072fb80b9aef728efd56a4164aced15",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:255f55c2e37cb90d76d74bf3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动已经开始了哦。\n快去，好好享受吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e63fb6e0ec38fa717696f8ab5bcadf7d8235fa5417c5e66b592866e954ed4a5d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b678f1267361f1162aefa9ad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真伤脑筋……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3d58a592d5ab84fa7667d408f1fffb10087a4950c884132ed091c385b5dd6219",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fbbb51d8b1883ef0d688a094",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "名鉴等级好像提升了。\n把至今为止发生的故事，\n讲给我听听吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd272632b4d78223dfa73811baa4a54b89883699232ab0234130305e79d6250e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec568f68338a321b99a30c12",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "根据目的地不同，气温会有很大变化。\n带件衬衫会比较方便。\n借你穿也行哦。尽管拿去用吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "37f2d6cd2316e358078fff22d3e195f81a76a9c9c18ab04e8f7a343379a2f71f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:860b124c7b6d1437b5dfb1ab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有香味？啊，是梦旅的味道吧。\n出门前，她帮我喷了一点。\n虽然她说……那是『驱虫水』。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3448b4422bbef17e7fae65fe2c1509fd3a80540d95642335c279f6f3a2ff1723",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1e0652f53b327f35eba5d218",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "伙伴们在街上凑齐的话还真是显眼呢。\n明明跟她们说过随心所欲地走就好，\n却不知为何总喜欢跟在我的身后。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dfd761274afa2032d799dbc3e2f1302a22ebca97a1a96b2e15c511c7273dd4af",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:049320e695787704372dd035",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喔，是平局啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a09b6290e1b52a658944911a0f7919f9e90b5b7d8dd1e95e025c7fd6e3c7c536",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b71e772a14d9ff9d5dfb6e15",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家，干得不错。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e01f95312bf52b296db5add96096dcdcfef80740e46c4ad95d8c4c6c46baf39",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:76d836cd8933cb1dd826c224",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真伤脑筋……",
      "source_fingerprint": "a4ccb36c03d2777c13c7571b44a85334c818bf9637b73de94b17519e4acc2c75",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:909385b021eaa2a6b9bfe876",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喔，是平局啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a09b6290e1b52a658944911a0f7919f9e90b5b7d8dd1e95e025c7fd6e3c7c536",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "1006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1073ad6b7fb225b8b84fe12e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这正是一座丰碑。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd5889862448f2e99c42022c38dda42ad5b4e013bed70bb09be3ae63b6f9150d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "1007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9e26e936b96ea5038a263428",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那么，准备开始吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "65e4f28178a3aa760cb622b2f0718f0a7659c15ed705f39c4525770a4dfb3ac9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "1008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e358bfa073f4e3ebff749a20",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Cygames",
      "source_fingerprint": "70f9f2ba202c631078563014e7f2f960d547e1d0cd4d1c18319f102cf5a87fcb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:34e4870e41c42e33acc6ff96",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果有想要达成的愿景，\n理应动用任何手段才对。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b9c4280997e59af655344dac3cdf43ed8a6198ce9077193d01fd869cb9db8adf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "110000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b9573fa9f6bf0e8c05102b5b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这就是前辈们开创出的蹄印吗。\n让我瞧瞧……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "91e655924e1e9ebd58199aa56fcbe134618dbd009ec05d0132e6d39ae9eb2a44",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "110001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:68505a80cb566e8f82e17aa8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要跑吗？\n随时奉陪哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e49a0872037196a19c0c53863725506f7e9e3dcff0fb3e84c52f38767daf3d65",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "110002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7eb26b9cd528183a3b985fbf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赛马娘 Pretty Derby！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c68d1ccbe412517d037eba3349a53caf52ee4216f3314987c5d59645520f8f8a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "12"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:034c4ab8ff24e9894d03cc01",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好烫……原来如此，这就是——",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9719f7cf87da9787444f76659c3eb5fc8463efcb1349dea5b291f074fdde321",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "120000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b8777bb8e4f3f5fc2e85c04d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "去大闹一场吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "034b12de4155c509aef975c567a0d678c43038c4b1e3aa483aa77e77dc106fd9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "1252"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6dcf483311b142703dce0e43",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "胜利的颜色是什么？",
      "source_fingerprint": "321826fc8e2d29767be5703e67d3f108e2044e29e5b7a34b0659cd4074871fca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "1253"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:685058d25427884920c3f2be",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是今天的登录奖励。\n要领走吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e4492cb41831298ee46aa464e3c78b3118db5cbd67a670c41933e0198faa1cc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "13"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:39a2bb9548af9477aa25ec2b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来吧，试着引导我吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d17c963e9fd54431b0c0cecfa117545e020cfeab2b264e3eff4d74e411a6fb98",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "140000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cccba540c5516321749c9489",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好嘞。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd20e4e08ef2350ddbc8c5229ad579bc46cbfde827fc9948a3ac0928e3ff95a9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "140001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c8f94db7a4ab120aaaf77058",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊——……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "48261918001fef99090d0124494c86e40288de5d8399c768eae1b936b034a781",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "140002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:91863ae7efc4e91b5fb37fac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这可真让我吃了一惊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6e34db3158a643a0550f8c5369afb60172ec10d378e9a54c0b032e37adbe5dbc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "140003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e11bb1faf1f1aba1ec0387c0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯，还不赖。",
      "source_fingerprint": "502de8993bcdde3058c7142728d7ac4022e01b26f03d266e4c382df85e1601ee",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "140004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:441fce0fc03183ea39f96fe9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦啦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2844e10231fb1df80ddf92369741a345d71164ac359effd4df72193851603d28",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "140005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc9b784b37cbd8359414260d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这可真让我吃了一惊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6e34db3158a643a0550f8c5369afb60172ec10d378e9a54c0b032e37adbe5dbc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "140006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:01698cc71386811449123948",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯，还不赖。",
      "source_fingerprint": "502de8993bcdde3058c7142728d7ac4022e01b26f03d266e4c382df85e1601ee",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "140007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e32cfb6d92245de9b18807e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8af85ce981d9ec89ad4d75b1bd062ebe03e9f22dc5edb7cd9b8099f05574c6c4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "140008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:97e4dd19c4a101f5a2d2d9e2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哼……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "75d69a6e9b47d8ba9190c672a87d66839e1073f6b8d155961afcac0de8c98426",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "140009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8e79c5d8913e3dced86b7af6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘿……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "399159bfab18af033ea050edb9eb321176037c32db1b8ed25b60841defb173e7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "140010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a2eb018efa4bee747e9f0e2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喔——。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e74067806423174fe8c1956eaef0ad224d2f55703f3195d64feab0f75a640bc2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "140011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e4af68d5c8db8c01c6658f70",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好厉害啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa490226869a16ea99073a043b963fa1e379499c333d8626194790e436f61a7f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "140012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b1a16f385dd4356099ba395",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "硬块……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b177c7dc0a3ff59ec5609dc2a482914e2e8904315bfa609317afa8588422f56",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "140013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a1ad1851788d6b1cba5d37be",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喔唷。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e9aefe68404a0c2238e67fee8bf967ecdce30258c1f814a1ac84fb05ebb0ca9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "140014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9694c224d4a9d1d97577b263",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那么……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "146069b643c6668acc74944c0a932644d0aaa363332a146c873f12a15bd68de7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "140015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aafa373bdd32faa6e8d053f3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怎么了？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8b931cbbc5ff834d619d16792036706cc06f14cf1a2024230235d3263006af89",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "140016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b38f49608a490425f201645",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔——。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e7573e0b54549e0d527881551f11ca695f88ac7d8c460ff3d2d2a4d1d93e5dd3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "140017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b3b3191c23e7b0c19043dda",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼——呜。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c5d4b191d713e092e8d0e14ba4e142233a3420bdadf56dc380fff4fa0a80cb6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "140018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:76959a0d0b593be8add0765b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "听说明天也准备了些什么。\n那就，明天也在这里见吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "82354119d25d870016d97c53b33ce5add3416f0b5abb68e6108e5fc4013a5aaa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "15"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81679ceaddd17eda8a78394d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔——……身体好沉。\n……好想去晒晒太阳啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1645e5bf0dba8301da432615f47970d3f6841f3a38a5e0a0a4565c366b4ae388",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "20000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2ce0b174b669caa9facc20d3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然我对体力挺有自信的……\n但这样子，好像哪儿也去不了了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "355d0ae451a83b8fee29420abd2fa8bc445451630bffe365312e337d2e546b48",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "20001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e660046f8af72add7cd8f0ba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那么，今天要做什么呢？\n什么都行哦，如果是现在的话……\n感觉能超越“自我”的壁垒。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a2be7be7eb5b123a9a687d378b514c5cc5116c866d544e87f60c7ff339bc6c18",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "20002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d9d27b9c6f1d65b61837afad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员，别太让我心急啊。\n今天我想好好动一动……\n再不快点，我就要擅自开始了哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dccfc94a055e03c834ccbd0fbb138fd7e3379751ef9e63b1664e746273374552",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "20003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:451bae68ed749ace92645425",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然我不是铃鹿……\n但那种想要奔跑的冲动，\n确实是按捺不住呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "16dd1669e90ba21dcfc84f3f16a77c0640fb9ae3507d1b0c02eae6a6ce3a3741",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "20004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6eaba18a0f30c576b6236418",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "灵魂与身体，完美地重叠……\n如此一来就能超越能力的框架。\n要试试看吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "76eb9961185b0570ff226f52a67fe46faf3bb9456d79c9f9d7b2fe9f8c41bece",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "20005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec74a8eeb84569e38f1167f5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "热身已经结束了。\n本来想就这样直接去旅行的……\n但我还是好好回来了哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fe3f60ca36a9b8a19cc8f4e3390fa6e0bcb59316085bb4f9a2034bf8749e308b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "20006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:22d69f19cf6101d88bb7b0c2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "关于你设计的，\n那种能粉碎记忆的训练菜单……\n就让我看看你的本事吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1bbb069915adf213ff9b28247b89892abccf033cc7b8a769773131c22a868dd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "20007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:65d08e0e7334d38604326fd0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……嘛，总有努力不起来的日子。\n就像目白光明那样，\n耐心地等待时机到来吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "968ad0e0c3a9eabf2c9b6f5e31482bd0d16f83e5729f4f06c3abe43fc31b9f08",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "20008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed7b59cae7cbae1377b51c06",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "提不起劲呢……\n这种时候尝试大幅改变环境\n也是一种手段哦。……比如去大海的另一头。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb12ac7983a91199494b3d632d95a3b71125b32c5aa028d91aab88c4bdbfb8af",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "20009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f4512e719ac804bc8aab568e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……嗯？啊，抱歉。\n我没在听。……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "376351dd6ad00e4879a5d0948995777d999dec684114959a03ee5b69d5214754",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "20010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3570fc493805e31fdff46d6f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……塔……湖……漫长的黑暗……。不行。\n这样感觉没法集中注意力呢……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a0fe91a068d89b78a9ed38001c58ca9f8e6d5536a1a3afd07bfbe5de4456717",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "20011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4bbd39a513ac839cb198764e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔——……虽然我在哪儿都能过，\n也自认还挺能撑的……\n但我投降了。好累！",
      "source_fingerprint": "41fde58586f4b32abd6beef8674b19952014cad5a39486874ef5b948acc50413",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "20021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e5d947bac4e33b1ffeb2d69",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无谋确实也能成为武器……\n呐，训练员。现在该怎么办？\n我想听听你的话。……来吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "69910c087356f9c217798f945004b6c708308c91330b3af0443b278940a68649",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "20022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:762cef98739b17528c07d38e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在你看来，现在的我如何？\n……不，不用回答。那双闪耀着\n金色光芒的眼眸——就是答案。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d3d45217ebfc7bd49deeb4ae385f029de2d7cdd42731eed882a54022e9c7d890",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "20023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:603939d2ebf01a065b9d4390",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果有什么会改变的话……\n或许就是今天了呢。\n……请在特等席上，见证到最后哦？",
      "source_fingerprint": "fc0e141a2735848d7c1ef25b15433a27e415682226c98cb8b2d5665ce6acc277",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "20024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:709daacf2f6069627e6bfec6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最好把我盯紧一点哦。\n别让我冲过终点后，就这样\n飞到什么不知名的地方去了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b19fc7af13eb818bf93bc471c665932faa0074c8c0fd0614b2da0cda5d3b43c4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "20025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d39b045a57f96d183057623",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "起风了……强烈且真切。\n嗯，今天……感觉能把握住。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e2bc21790683e6ff488f80e434519dbcea860aae4e1183ab85397bac9c5bd01e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "20026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1b876988e0455b46921ffd2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "能听到吗？那是期待着比赛的\n巨大欢呼声。置身其中奔跑的话……\n哈哈，一定会相当舒服吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3df138abb4b3e4eff14b457a4b153bf89ab88b88d97f5f3b9b00359edf2a45bd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "20027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a157c295c3f747fe204f791f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "肚子也空得恰到好处。\n填得太饱，就没法产生贪欲了……\n稍微保持点饥饿感反而更好。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b4846a08888ea63efdfa6ee527c874e67d9aeb7a0b7b3d559f12a3480f124e78",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "20028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:153be1c38b2fb7862748e38c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在比赛前，最好别离我太近。\n因为我太过于集中精神了……\n说不定会不小心踢到你哦？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba0b3015ea40c38d9ccba3179654eec2caac0bc5df0568617389a679ee69c055",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "20029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:55ba8ebe19201f5dda9c3663",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赛场遍布各地。哪怕只是\n稍微走走，感受各地的空气……\n也能体验到旅行的心情呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e42e48537352edf8b7e3667a657a8537518233a974f989cc584fa07dbea40754",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "20030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9cd98e005dc931641f5e664b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哇！\n……哈哈，紧张感消退了吗？\n别那么死板，享受其中吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e4ff0033c88be507050566b9a5b1ce6c662b6aee0053b8fcc73e4a96612efeec",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "20031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1a8cfaccbead58b5d5c70af",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "深呼吸。与世界融为一体。\n让感官变得敏锐……\n再来一次。直到合而为一为止……",
      "source_fingerprint": "17b9abe50565151789cefe579b87b7d93609614462fe2926e8b1553da6abfab0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "20032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cbebe4a8fd999ce06ca43b5e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔——……总觉得，心神\n有些飘散。请让我\n集中到“这边”来……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d4eddc2dd22e82e99a488874c99398ab06411ad53e3770ddc1d2790ca5a221d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "20033"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
